    {
      "type": "practice",
      "id": 10,
      "prompt": "A vector has magnitude $6$ and direction angle $\\frac{5\\pi}{6}$. Write it in component form, giving exact values.",
      "hint": "Use $\\langle r\\cos\\theta, \\, r\\sin\\theta \\rangle$. Recall $\\cos\\frac{5\\pi}{6} = -\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{2}$ and $\\sin\\frac{5\\pi}{6} = \\frac{1}{2}$.",
